# Never ship host artifacts into the build context. In docker-first dev these
# shouldn't exist on the host anyway (deps live in named volumes), but this keeps
# the prod `build` stage hermetic and the image small.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
.git
.env
*.log
output
*.csv
!apps/api/test/fixtures/*.csv
*.png
backup-*.sql
input
*.xls
*.xlsx
New folder
samples
